# ==============================================================================
# PROJECT DIRECTIVES & SYSTEM RULES - HEALTH, BATCHCOOKING & COACHING PWA
# ==============================================================================

## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW & STACK
- Type: Progressive Web App (PWA) optimized for mobile (iPhone).
- UI Framework: Next.js (React) + Tailwind CSS + Lucide Icons.
- Design System: Apple Health (minimalist). Light: blue-gray page `#F2F4F8`, 16px white cards. Dark: page `#000000`, cards `#1C1C1E` (iOS grouped). Tokens in `app/globals.css` (`--c-bg`, `--c-card`, `--c-ink`, …) + Tailwind `health.*`. Toggle: Moon/Sun in the top bar (`context/ThemeContext.tsx`). Persist `coach-nutrition:theme` (`light` | `dark`); until the user toggles, follow `prefers-color-scheme`. Boot script on `<html>` to avoid flash (`html.dark`).
- Color Coding: Coral/Orange accents for Profile 1, Purple/Blue accents for Profile 2. Goal status (Tab 1) uses green / red / amber via `lib/macro-status.ts`, not the profile accent.
- Backend & Database: Supabase (PostgreSQL, Auth, Storage).
- Auth : **un seul code foyer** (pas d’identifiant à l’écran). Session cookie `cn_foyer` 180 j. Face ID / passkey par iPhone (`lib/auth`). 3 essais puis pause 15 min. Middleware bloque pages + `/api/*` (sauf `/api/auth/*` et webhooks Santé). Gemini n’est plus appelable sans session. Alexis / Élodie restent des `profile_id`, pas des users Auth. RLS prod : `supabase/migrations/lock_rls_household.sql` (authenticated only).
- Secrets: only in `.env.local` (and Vercel). Keep Supabase URL + anon key, Gemini, Strava, Health webhook, **HOUSEHOLD_PASSWORD** / **HOUSEHOLD_SESSION_SECRET**. NEVER OpenAI / Anthropic. NEVER commit the foyer password.
- External APIs & Data Bridges:
  - OpenFoodFacts API (Barcode scanning).
 - Open-Meteo (`GET /api/weather`, **Eschentzwiller** `lib/season.ts` `ESCHENTZWILLER_LAT` / `LON`, no key) — saison (mois Paris) + météo teintent `--c-bg` en clair (`data-season` / `data-weather` on `<html>`). Pluie / neige / canicule (≥28 °C) écrasent la teinte saison. Pastille barre du haut (`WeatherChip`) : **icône + actuel + min/max**, jamais le mot Soleil/Pluie à côté de l’icône (aria-label only). **Tap** → feuille **7 jours** portail `document.body` (pas dans le header `backdrop-blur` / sticky — sinon iOS recadre en une barre). Icône + min/max, pas de libellé ciel à côté ; croix + tap hors feuille pour fermer. Never a paid weather API. Pas de silhouettes saison.
  - Google Gemini API Routing:
    - **Gemini Pro Model**: Dedicated to the "Gem Chef Cuistot". Models are resolved live via `GET /v1beta/models` (`lib/gemini/models.ts`) — do not hardcode a version. On 429/404 Pro, fall through to Flash with a user-facing warning. Never retired `gemini-2.5-pro` as a required pin.
    - **Gemini Flash Model**: Dedicated to Sports/Activity Coaching (Tab 4), daily logging, Vision, OCR, cardio/hypertrophy planners (Tab 2). Resolved live from the Gemini model list (prefer newest Flash, then lite). Never pin a retired `gemini-2.5-*` id.
    - **Wait UX**: every Gemini call goes through `withGeminiWait` (`lib/gemini/wait.ts`) → silhouette overlay `GeminiWaitHost` in `AppShell`. Never dump raw API JSON (404, model ids) in the UI.
    - **Timeouts**: per-attempt AbortSignal 120s Pro / 75s Flash (`lib/gemini/models.ts`). Vercel `maxDuration` in `vercel.json` + route `export const maxDuration` (generate-meals 300s, typical Flash 90s). On 429/404 Pro, fall through to Flash with a user-facing warning. JSON retry; do not throw away a generated week on a mere theme mismatch.
  - Strava: **no free live API** (Standard Tier needs a Strava subscription since 2026-06-30). Ingest stays **Strava → Apple Santé → iOS Shortcut webhook**. Optional `source: strava` on `workouts[]`. Sport sessions ONLY — no daily steps, no NEAT / passive kcal. Do not scrape. Paid API token in Paramètres is optional (included with Strava Premium, no extra developer fee).
  - Apple Health (Watch / iPhone / Strava via Santé): steps + **Active** energy + workouts, imported via iOS Shortcut → Supabase webhook. Source for Tab 1 Activité tiles and for matching **Séance du jour**. Never a **Hors sport** kcal tile (redundant with Active when no session kcal).
  - RENPHO / Weight sync: NO direct Renpho API exists. Weight and body composition metrics will be imported via two methods: 1) A Supabase Webhook to receive data from an iOS Shortcut (Apple Health automation), and 2) AI Vision OCR (via Gemini Flash) to extract metrics from a screenshot of the Renpho app.

